00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.340
Birth certificate.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.620
It's a piece of paper.

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:41.200
How can that be racist?

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.650
How could that be a dog whistle?

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.799
Well, you have to look at its use.

00:02:44.799 --> 00:02:46.409
You have to look at who is using it.

00:02:46.409 --> 00:02:52.689
You have to look at what is being suggested
or implied by its use within, there's so many

00:02:52.689 --> 00:02:54.169
